; expect 15
; An entry-file FUNCTION beside an imported macro of the same name.
; The macro used to win at every call site - and with the arities
; agreeing, silently: this file answered 10 (the macro's doubling)
; where the function says 15, with no diagnostic from anything.
; That is MAC-HYG-8's third hole, closed 2026-08-14: a bare
; invocation whose name a bare `fn`/`::` declares is the function's,
; mirroring `findFnEnt`'s entry-file resolution, unless the macro
; belongs to the invocation site's own module. The macro stays
; reachable by qualification - 368 exercises that spelling.
(import QualMac)
(:: qdbl (-> Int Int))
(fn (qdbl n) (* n 3))
(:: main Int)
(fn (main) (qdbl 5))
